,"background_image":"https://cloud01.albox.co/seasons/7e7eed69-ecf3-4aa4-9759-42426dcf7c7b.jpg","likes":31,"dislikes":1,"views":3223,"release_date":"1662595200000","season_number":1,"description":"After his parents mysteriously disappeared eight years ago, young Eric Dalaras embarks on a search for the truth and enters a frightening world. He and his sister Uma grew up with their maternal grandparents. Eric decides to leave his homeland to return to the place of his childhood, Cabo Qwert, where he wants to look for answers at the Tierra Incógnita horror amusement park, since this is where his parents were last seen. Together with his friends, his sister and his aunt, Eric must overcome his fears in order to solve the riddles that ultimately lead him to the answers to all his questions, which are hidden in a cosmos as unknown as it is dark.\r\n","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":5.4}],"value":5.4,"age":"PG"},"background_color":"","current_season_id":14778,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}